  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be given as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>If the area bounded by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;sq units, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi></math> is equal to",
